     "difficulty": 3, "bloom": "apply"},

    {"id": 9, "type": "manual", "slot": "(a) the three transformations, in order",
     "desc": "Part (a): a correct answer must name all three moves from the parent graph y = x squared -- a horizontal shift of 1 to the right, a vertical stretch by a factor of 2 together with a reflection in the x-axis (the minus 2 in front), and a vertical shift of 8 up -- and must apply the horizontal shift before the vertical one. Naming only the shifts, or reading the shift as 1 to the left, is not full credit.",
     "skill": "transformations", "facet": "transformations", "standard": "HSF-BF.B.3",
     "difficulty": 3, "bloom": "justify"},
